    "Ayurveda & Asana Yoga uses your calendar to save your meals, shopping lists, and workouts. Please grant permission in Settings to use these features.": {},
    "Ayurveda & Asana Yoga uses notifications to remind you about your meals, workouts, shopping lists, AI suggestions, and other important features. Please enable notifications in Settings to stay on track and get the most out of Ayurveda & Asana Yoga.": {},
